          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rest of the deeds of Hezekiah, and all his might, and how he made the pool and the conduit and brought water into the city, are they not written in the Book of the Chronicles of the Kings of Judah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Hezekiah slept with his fathers; and Manasseh his son reigned in his stead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
